>Description:
The box bootp's off a master FreeBSD NFS server.  When the Alpha box first starts, link and activity lights work.  The box bootp's, starts netboot, then loads the kernel.

As soon as the kernel starts, the link and activity lights dissapear.  The dc driver detects the dual onboard 21143 based 10/100 Ethernet:

dc0: <Intel 21143 10/100BaseTX> port 0x1100-0x117f mem 0x20c2000-0x20c23ff irq 29 at device 9.0 on pci0
