> to 32-bit archs works.)

Actually I think you may have that backwards.  My experience is that
a 32 -> 64 bit cross build works fine, but a 64 -> 32 bit cross
build fails.  (Yes, I realize that is counter-intuitive.)  Aside
from my personal experience, I've read in several places that the
"64x32 cross" is broken.

By the way, the Modula-3 system uses a slightly modified GCC backend
to generate code.  Building Alpha executables on an i386 definitely
works in that case.

