MIME-Version: 1
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="--==_Exmh_-8426424860"

This is a multipart MIME message.

--==_Exmh_-8426424860
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii


The attached patch _should_ fix (amongst other things) the operation of 
Mylex RAID controllers on Alpha systems.  I've been running this code 
here for a while now, and apart from a problem unloading the driver if 
it's a module, it's been quite stable.

I'd _like_ to get this into 4.x so that we can claim support for these 
controllers on Alpha as well, but I'd really like at least one other 
success story first.

Thanks for any feedback.

(Note that this patch doesn't address the Digital-branded Mylex 
 controllers yet.)


--==_Exmh_-8426424860
