Unit numbers != SCSI address.

Doa a 'camcontrol devlist' to find what the unit id is of this new drive.
If you hadn't rebooted before attaching the disk, do a 'camcontrol rescan
<BUSNUMBER>'.

This said, there've been some somewhat hard to predict issues with the
disklabel code and Alpha/FreeBSD which have made access of the daN sometimes
not work- but this seems mostly to be due to having a stale DOS header.

